title:loadPhase
---
<<declare $dialogPhase= "">>
<<declare $visitedYet = false>>
<<check_bool NPC>>
<<dialogPhaseSetter NPC>>
<<if $dialogPhase == "start">>
    <<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken">>
    <<jump Quest_Taken>>

<<elseif $dialogPhase == "has_trophy">>
    <<jump Has_Trophy>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "no_trophy">>
    <<jump No_Trophy>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Start
---
<<set $visitedYet to true>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Town Elder: Finally, you're here! We have been waiting for our savior!
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    -> Yes, sir, how can I be of service?
    -> I'm here to do my best
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Town Elder: You see, we have been hearing the echoes of howling Yetis from the mountains.
Town Elder: No one has been able to venture outside of the village out of fear. They keep us awake ‘til dark hours.
Town Elder: The people, they’re afraid to sleep, y’know.  
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    -> Don’t worry! I’ll take care of the beasts and bring you back their heads.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Town Elder: Oh, thank you graciously! They reside in the cave just outside of the village. 
        Town Elder: Be careful. They can be real unpredictable.
        <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC quest_taken>>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    ->Yetis, you say? You folk get Yetis in this region?
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Town Elder: They have terrorized these lands for generations! Will you help us?
             <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
            -> Of course. I will slay the beasts!
                 <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
                Town Elder: Oh, thank you graciously! They reside in the cave just outside of the village. 
                Town Elder: Be careful; they can be real unpredictable. 
                <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC quest_taken>>
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>

===
title: Quest_Taken
position: 42,46
---
Town Elder: Just mosey up on the mountain there. You'll find a cave near by the village.
Town Elder: That's where all that noise has been coming from.
===
title: Has_Trophy
---
Town Elder: How'd it go? I heard howling so loud!
    -> I don't have any heads to give you... But I wont this trophy...
    ->(Hand the elder the trophy)
Town Elder: What...?
    -> Don’t worry, they have all gone home for the night. The people can rest easy. 
Town Elder: Thank you, kind adventurer! We are beyond grateful.
    -> It's SNOW problem.


===

title: No_Trophy
---
Town Elder: How'd it go? I heard howling so loud!
    ->It was awful! It's a comedy club full of yetis!! I was almost eaten alive!
        Town Elder: Comedy club?? I sent you to kill the beast not show them a good time!
        Town Elder: If you wanted laughs so bad you should tell better jokes than that. Comedy club...wow 
        Town Elder: Leave this town! I'll get someone better *scoff*
    ->Those yetis have no sense of humor, good luck I'm out of here! 
        Town Elder: Semse of humor? I sent you to kill them not make friends!!
        Town Elder: Fine, shoo I'll get someone more competent then you to kill them.
            //<<change_scene Fail>>

===